@page "/add-to-home-screen"

<PageTitle>Add to Home Screen - Dealer School Trainer</PageTitle>

<h1>Add to Home Screen</h1>

@* Shown instead of the steps when the site is already running from its
   home-screen icon (see app.css, display-mode: standalone). *@
<div class="mode-card install-already" style="max-width: 500px;">
    <p><strong>You're already using the app version.</strong></p>
    <p>The trainer is running from your home screen, with no browser bars taking up space.</p>
</div>

<div class="install-steps">
    <div class="mode-card" style="max-width: 500px;">
        <p><strong>For the best experience on your phone, add the Dealer School Trainer to your home screen.</strong></p>
        <p>It opens from its own icon, just like an app &mdash; no address bar or browser toolbar, so the games get the whole screen. It takes about 10 seconds, it's free, and nothing needs to be downloaded from an app store.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mode-card" style="max-width: 500px;">
        <h3 class="install-heading">iPhone / iPad (Safari)</h3>
        <ol class="install-list">
            <li>Open this site in <strong>Safari</strong>.</li>
            <li>Tap the <strong>Share</strong> button (the square with an arrow pointing up).</li>
            <li>Scroll down and tap <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>.</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Add</strong> in the top-right corner.</li>
            <li>Open the trainer from the new <strong>Dealer Trainer</strong> icon on your home screen.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mode-card" style="max-width: 500px;">
        <h3 class="install-heading">Android (Chrome)</h3>
        <ol class="install-list">
            <li>Open this site in <strong>Chrome</strong>.</li>
            <li>Tap the <strong>&#8942;</strong> menu (three dots, top-right).</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Install app</strong> or <strong>Add to Home screen</strong> (the wording depends on your version of Chrome).</li>
            <li>Confirm by tapping <strong>Install</strong> or <strong>Add</strong>.</li>
            <li>Open the trainer from the new <strong>Dealer Trainer</strong> icon on your home screen.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mode-card" style="max-width: 500px;">
        <p style="margin: 0;">Updates to the trainer show up automatically &mdash; there's nothing to reinstall.</p>
    </div>
</div>
